OL,5,G0930 Essential Classics
OL,6,     FGeorgia Mann plays the best in
OL,7,     Fclassical music, with discoveries
OL,8,     Fand surprises rubbing shoulders
OL,9,     Fwith familiar favourites.
OL,10,G1300 Classical Live
OL,11,     FLinton Stephens introduces an
OL,12,     Fafternoon of specially made
OL,13,     Frecordings including musical
OL,14,     Fhighlights from the BBC National
OL,15,     FOrchestra of Wales, LSO St Luke's
OL,16,     Fand Ensemble Moliere.
