OL,5,G2200 Late Junction
OL,6,     FVerity Sharp is hot out of the
OL,7,     Fgate with a selection of tracks
OL,8,     Finspired by, made from, and
OL,9,     Frelated to horses. Expect
OL,10,     Fhorse-hair harps and musical
OL,11,     Fequine pilgrimages.
OL,12,G2330 'Round Midnight
OL,13,     FTonight Soweto pays homage the
OL,14,     Flate totemic saxophonist Sonny
OL,15,     FRollins, who sadly passed away on
OL,16,     F25 May. Along the way, Soweto
OL,17,     Fhears from Melissa Aldana and Jean
OL,18,     FToussaint.
